      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T11:50:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just thinking how to eliminate the change in ConnectedClientsTrackers, because it doesn\u0027t need to care about whether it is localOnly or not.\nOption 1:\nStore last hotspot clients and last localOnly clients in Tethering, if one of them callback, concat with the other one before passing to updateConnectedClients.\nOption 2:\nUse different ConnectedClientsTrackers for hotspot clients and localOnly clients",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2723,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 2724,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "80744ae79d1ddd5f71e0383dc38a27f38792ee1d",
